
# Fuzzy Card

---
When adding an &aNBT item to a filter&r, by default, the filter will attempt to &amatch its NBT&r. The &bFuzzy Tablet&r allows you to filter items as if they did not have NBT. 

For example, when &aadding a potion to an &bImport Fulcrum&r's filter&r, only the &aspecific type of potion will be imported&r. By adding a &bFuzzy Tablet&r on the "Match Any" mode to the &bImport Fulcrum&r, &aany potion type will be imported&r.

The &bFuzzy Tablet&r allows for additional filtering by &adamage levels&r. This can be used for &afiltering out damaged tools or armor&r with finer detail.

&dNote: storing NBT items within your Nexus can cause lag&r
            